abstract: "Official Python implementation of VES-ECG (Variance-Evaluated Stability for ECG Analysis), a scale-invariant, variance-stabilized framework for real-time cardiac signal quality assessment and artifact vetting across 21,730 PhysioNet MIT-BIH clinical heartbeats. Submitted to Biomedical Signal Processing and Control (Elsevier)."
